      "settings": {
        "image": "as_3x2_2",
        "image_side": "right",
        "body": "<p>Common Ground started in 2014 with two racks, a borrowed rower and six people who trained before work. We moved to Foundry Lane in 2016 and opened Riverside in 2023.</p><p>Ten years on the idea is the same: good coaching, a room full of people who show up, and nobody left at the back.</p>",
